            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"b-without-return\">\u270f\ufe0f B \u00b7 Without <code>return</code></h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Copy <code>count_shares</code> into a new cell under a new name, and put <code>print(...)</code> where the <code>return</code> was. Call it and keep the result in a name. In a markdown cell under it, answer: what does that name hold, and what could the next cell do with it?</span></span>"
