            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><code>/ma/towns</code> takes a <code>county</code>. Pass parameters as a dictionary with <code>params=</code>, and <code>requests</code> builds the address. <code>.url</code> shows the address it built.</span></span>"
