            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">The server answered <strong>401</strong>, with <code>{\"detail\": \"Missing x-token header\"}</code>. Without the <code>x-token</code> header, the request has a message but no name to put next to it, so the server refuses it rather than writing an anonymous line.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">It needs to know who sent a message for the same reason a check needs a signature: the board shows one line per student, and without a token the server cannot tell whose line to write, update, or later delete. The token is also what stops anyone from posting under someone else's name, or flooding the board anonymously.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
